compile.prompt:
Compile these approved training examples into a single training entry suitable for a loadContext training.json file.

Task: {task_description}
Quality criteria: {quality_criteria}

Approved examples from the loop:
{examples}

Format as a single string value containing all examples, each separated by a blank line, in this format:
Example N
Input: [the input/question]
Output: [the expected output/answer]

Only include examples that were approved. Make sure the format is consistent across all examples.
